c Neo&#x27;, &#x27;Malgun Gothic&#x27;, sans-serif;margin:0;padding:24px 0\\"><table align=\\"center\\" width=\\"100%\\" border=\\"0\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"max-width:560px;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;margin:0 auto\\"><tbody><tr style=\\"width:100%\\"><td style=\\"padding:32px\\"><h1 style=\\"color:#1a1a1a;font-size:22px;line-height:30px;margin:0 0 16px\\">Team plans are here</h1><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">지민님, 안녕하세요.</p><table align=\\"center\\" width=\\"100%\\" border=\\"0\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" data-lf-promo=\\"true\\" style=\\"margin:0 0 12px\\"><tbody><tr><td><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">You can now share one workspace across your whole team.</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">Pay once for every seat.</p><table align=\\"center\\" width=\\"100%\\" border=\\"0\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"margin:20px 0 8px\\"><tbody><tr><td><table align=\\"center\\" width=\\"100%\\" border=\\"0\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"margin:0 0 12px\\"><tbody><tr><td><a href=\\"https://sampleco.test/pricing\\" style=\\"line-height:100%;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;background-color:#1a1a1a;border-radius:6px;color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;padding:12px 20px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:20px\\" target=\\"_blank\\"><span><!--[if mso]><i style=\\"mso-font-width:500%;mso-text-raise:18px\\" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style=\\"max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px\\">See team plans</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style=\\"mso-font-width:500%\\" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a><p data-skip-in-text=\\"true\\" data-lf-fallback-link=\\"true\\" style=\\"font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#777777;margin:6px 0 0;word-break:break-all;margin-top:6px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0\\">버튼이 열리지 않으면 아래 링크를 브라우저에 붙여 넣어 주세요: <a href=\\"https://sampleco.test/pricing\\" style=\\"color:#555555;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline\\" target=\\"_blank\\">https://sampleco.test/pricing</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><hr style=\\"width:100%;border:none;border-color:#e5e5e5;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;margin:24px 0 16px\\"/><table align=\\"center\\" width=\\"100%\\" border=\\"0\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" data-lf-ad-footer=\\"true\\"><tbody><tr><td><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">광고 메일이에요. Example Co.의 광고성 메일 수신에 동의하셔서 보내 드려요.</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">This is an advertisement sent by Example Co. to people who agreed to receive its marketing emails.</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">이 메일을 더 받고 싶지 않다면 한 번에 수신거부할 수 있어요. 로그인하지 않아도 돼요.</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">Don&#x27;t want these emails? Unsubscribe in one click. You don&#x27;t need to sign in.</p><table align=\\"center\\" width=\\"100%\\" border=\\"0\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"margin:20px 0 8px\\"><tbody><tr><td><table align=\\"center\\" width=\\"100%\\" border=\\"0\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"margin:0 0 12px\\"><tbody><tr><td><a href=\\"https://sampleco.test/api/marketing/unsubscribe?t=test-unsubscribe-token\\" style=\\"line-height:100%;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:6px;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;padding:11px 19px;padding-top:11px;padding-right:19px;padding-bottom:11px;padding-left:19px\\" target=\\"_blank\\"><span><!--[if mso]><i style=\\"mso-font-width:475%;mso-text-raise:16.5px\\" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style=\\"max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:8.25px\\">수신거부 / Unsubscribe</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style=\\"mso-font-width:475%\\" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a><p data-skip-in-text=\\"true\\" data-lf-fallback-link=\\"true\\" style=\\"font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#777777;margin:6px 0 0;word-break:break-all;margin-top:6px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0\\">버튼이 열리지 않으면 아래 링크를 브라우저에 붙여 넣어 주세요: <a href=\\"https://sampleco.test/api/marketing/unsubscribe?t=test-unsubscribe-token\\" style=\\"color:#555555;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline\\" target=\\"_blank\\">https://sampleco.test/api/marketing/unsubscribe?t=test-unsubscribe-token</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 4px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0\\">전송자: Example Co.</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 4px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0\\">이메일: hello@example.test</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 4px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0\\">전화: +82 10-0000-0000</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 4px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0\\">주소: 1 Example-ro, Seoul 00000, KR</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>",
  "text": "TEAM PLANS ARE HERE\\n\\n지민님, 안녕하세요.\\n\\nYou can now share one workspace across your whole team.\\n\\nPay once for every seat.\\n\\nSee team plans https://sampleco.test/pricing\\n\\n----------------------------------------\\n\\n광고 메일이에요. Example Co.의 광고성 메일 수신에 동의하셔서 보내 드려요.\\n\\nThis is an advertisement sent by Example Co. to people who agreed to receive its marketing emails.\\n\\n이 메일을 더 받고 싶지 않다면 한 번에 수신거부할 수 있어요. 로그인하지 않아도 돼요.\\n\\nDon't want these emails? Unsubscribe in one click. You don't need to sign in.\\n\\n수신거부 / Unsubscribe https://sampleco.test/api/marketing/unsubscribe?t=test-unsubscribe-token\\n\\n전송자: Example Co.\\n\\n이메일: hello@example.test\\n\\n전화: +82 10-0000-0000\\n\\n주소: 1 Example-ro, Seoul 00000, KR"
}
`;

