e SD Gothic Neo&#x27;, &#x27;Malgun Gothic&#x27;, sans-serif;margin:0;padding:24px 0\\"><table align=\\"center\\" width=\\"100%\\" border=\\"0\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"max-width:560px;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;margin:0 auto\\"><tbody><tr style=\\"width:100%\\"><td style=\\"padding:32px\\"><h1 style=\\"color:#1a1a1a;font-size:22px;line-height:30px;margin:0 0 16px\\">Result of your marketing message preferences</h1><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">Hi Jamie,</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">Sender: SampleCo Inc. — We processed your marketing message preferences as follows.</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#1a1a1a;margin:0 0 12px;font-weight:600;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">Email · Opt-in · Date of your request: October 1, 2026</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">Result: your opt-in has been applied.</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#1a1a1a;margin:0 0 12px;font-weight:600;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">Text message (SMS) · Opt-out (consent withdrawn) · Date of your request: October 1, 2026</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">Result: your opt-out has been applied. We will not send marketing messages through this channel.</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">You can change your preferences in your account settings at any time. This is a notice of the result required by law, not an advertisement.</p><hr style=\\"width:100%;border:none;border-color:#e5e5e5;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;margin:24px 0 16px\\"/><p style=\\"font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#777777;margin:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0\\">You are receiving this email because you have an account with SampleCo.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>",
  "text": "RESULT OF YOUR MARKETING MESSAGE PREFERENCES\\n\\nHi Jamie,\\n\\nSender: SampleCo Inc. — We processed your marketing message preferences as follows.\\n\\nEmail · Opt-in · Date of your request: October 1, 2026\\n\\nResult: your opt-in has been applied.\\n\\nText message (SMS) · Opt-out (consent withdrawn) · Date of your request: October 1, 2026\\n\\nResult: your opt-out has been applied. We will not send marketing messages through this channel.\\n\\nYou can change your preferences in your account settings at any time. This is a notice of the result required by law, not an advertisement.\\n\\n----------------------------------------\\n\\nYou are receiving this email because you have an account with SampleCo."
}
