{
  "subject": "SampleCo: do you still want our marketing emails?",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \\"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\\" \\"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\\"><html dir=\\"ltr\\" lang=\\"en\\"><head><meta content=\\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\\" http-equiv=\\"Content-Type\\"/><meta name=\\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\\"/><title>We check every two years that you still want marketing emails.</title></head><body dir=\\"ltr\\" lang=\\"en\\" style=\\"background-color:#f6f6f4;margin:0;padding:0\\"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><div style=\\"display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0\\" data-skip-in-text=\\"true\\">We check every two years that you still want marketing emails.<div> ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿</div></div><!--body--><table border=\\"0\\" width=\\"100%\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" align=\\"center\\"><tbody><tr><td dir=\\"ltr\\" lang=\\"en\\" style=\\"background-color:#f6f6f4;font-family:-apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, &#x27;Apple SD Gothic Neo&#x27;, &#x27;Malgun Gothic&#x27;, sans-serif;margin:0;padding:24px 0\\"><table align=\\"center\\" width=\\"100%\\" border=\\"0\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"max-width:560px;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;margin:0 auto\\"><tbody><tr style=\\"width:100%\\"><td style=\\"padding:32px\\"><h1 style=\\"color:#1a1a1a;font-size:22px;line-height:30px;margin:0 0 16px\\">Do you still want our marketing emails?</h1><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">Hi Jamie,</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#1a1a1a;margin:0 0 12px;font-weight:600;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">Sender: SampleCo Inc. — You agreed to receive marketing emails from us on September 30, 2024.</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">We check every two years that you still want these emails, as the law requires.</p><table align=\\"center\\" width=\\"100%\\" border=\\"0\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"margin:20px 0 8px\\"><tbody><tr><td><table align=\\"center\\" width=\\"100%\\" border=\\"0\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"margin:0 0 12px\\"><tbody><tr><td><a href=\\"https://sampleco.test/api/marketing/keep?t=test-keep-token\\" style=\\"line-height:100%;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;background-color:#1a1a1a;border-radius:6px;color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;padding:12px 20px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:20px\\" target=\\"_blank\\"><span><!--[if mso]><i style=\\"mso-font-width:500%;mso-text-raise:18px\\" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style=\\"max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px\\">Keep getting these emails</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style=\\"mso-font-width:500%\\" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a><p data-skip-in-text=\\"true\\" data-lf-fallback-link=\\"true\\" style=\\"font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#777777;margin:6px 0 0;word-break:break-all;margin-top:6px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0\\">If the button doesn&#x27;t work, copy this link into your browser: <a href=\\"https://sampleco.test/api/marketing/keep?t=test-keep-token\\" style=\\"color:#555555;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline\\" target=\\"_blank\\">https://sampleco.test/api/marketing/keep?t=test-keep-token</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\\"center\\" width=\\"100%\\" border=\\"0\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"margin:0 0 12px\\"><tbody><tr><td><a href=\\"https://sampleco.test/api/marketing/unsubscribe?t=test-unsubscribe-token\\" style=\\"line-height:100%;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:6px;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;padding:11px 19px;padding-top:11px;padding-right:19px;padding-bottom:11px;padding-left:19px\\" target=\\"_blank\\"><span><!--[if mso]><i style=\\"mso-font-width:475%;mso-text-raise:16.5px\\" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style=\\"max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:8.25px\\">Unsubscribe</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style=\\"mso-font-width:475%\\" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a><p data-skip-in-text=\\"true\\" data-lf-fallback-link=\\"true\\" style=\\"font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#777777;margin:6px 0 0;word-break:break-all;margin-top:6px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0\\">If the button doesn&#x27;t work, copy this link into your browser: <a href=\\"https://sampleco.test/api/marketing/unsubscribe?t=test-unsubscribe-token\\" style=\\"color:#555555;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline\\" target=\\"_blank\\">https://sampleco.test/api/marketing/unsubscribe?t=test-unsubscribe-token</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">This link works for 60 days.</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">You can unsubscribe at any time with the second button. You don&#x27;t need to sign in.</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">If you do nothing, nothing changes: you keep getting these emails until you unsubscribe.</p><hr style=\\"width:100%;border:none;border-color:#e5e5e5;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;margin:24px 0 16px\\"/><p style=\\"font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#777777;margin:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0\\">You are receiving this email because you have an account with SampleCo.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>",
  "text": "DO YOU STILL WANT OUR MARKETING EMAILS?\\n\\nHi Jamie,\\n\\nSender: SampleCo Inc. — You agreed to receive marketing emails from us on September 30, 2024.\\n\\nWe check every two years that you still want these emails, as the law requires.\\n\\nKeep getting these emails https://sampleco.test/api/marketing/keep?t=test-keep-token\\n\\nUnsubscribe https://sampleco.test/api/marketing/unsubscribe?t=test-unsubscribe-token\\n\\nThis link works for 60 days.\\n\\nYou can unsubscribe at any time with the second button. You don't need to sign in.\\n\\nIf you do nothing, nothing changes: you keep getting these emails until you unsubscribe.\\n\\n----------------------------------------\\n\\nYou are receiving this email because you have an account with SampleCo."
}
`;

exports[`스냅숏: marketingReconfirm (ko) 1`] = `
{
  "subject": "SampleCo 광고성 메일을 계속 받을지 확인해 주세요",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \\"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\\" \\"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\\"><html dir=\\"ltr\\" lang=\\"ko\\"><head><meta content=\\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\\" http-equiv=\\"Content-Type\\"/><meta name=\\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\\"/><title>광고성 메일을 계속 받고 싶은지 2년마다 확인해요.</title></head><body dir=\\"ltr\\" lang=\\"en\\" style=\\"background-color:#f6f6f4;margin:0;padding:0\\"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><div style=\\"display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0\\" data-skip-in-text=\\"true\\">광고성 메일을 계속 받고 싶은지 2년마다 확인해요.<div> ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿</div></div><!--body--><table border=\\"0\\" width=\\"100%\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" align=\\"center\\"><tbody><tr><td dir=\\"ltr\\" lang=\\"en\\" style=\\"background-color:#f6f6f4;font-family:-apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, &#x27;Apple SD Gothic Neo&#x27;, &#x27;Malgun Gothic&#x27;, sans-serif;margin:0;padding:24px 0\\"><table align=\\"center\\" width=\\"100%\\" border=\\"0\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"max-width:560px;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;margin:0 auto\\"><tbody><tr style=\\"width:100%\\"><td style=\\"padding:32px\\"><h1 style=\\"color:#1a1a1a;font-size:22px;line-height:30px;margin:0 0 16px\\">광고성 메일을 계속 받을까요?</h1><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">지민님, 안녕하세요.</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#1a1a1a;margin:0 0 12px;font-weight:600;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">전송자: SampleCo Inc. — 2024년 9월 30일에 광고성 메일 수신에 동의하셨어요.</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">법에 따라 2년마다 계속 받고 싶은지 확인해요.</p><table align=\\"center\\" width=\\"100%\\" border=\\"0\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"margin:20px 0 8px\\"><tbody><tr><td><table align=\\"center\\" width=\\"100%\\" border=\\"0\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"margin:0 0 12px\\"><tbody><tr><td><a href=\\"https://sampleco.test/api/marketing/keep?t=test-keep-token\\" style=\\"line-height:100%;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;background-color:#1a1a1a;border-radius:6px;color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;padding:12px 20px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:20px\\" target=\\"_blank\\"><span><!--[if mso]><i style=\\"mso-font-width:500%;mso-text-raise:18px\\" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style=\\"max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px\\">계속 받기</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style=\\"mso-font-width:500%\\" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a><p data-skip-in-text=\\"true\\" data-lf-fallback-link=\\"true\\" style=\\"font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#777777;margin:6px 0 0;word-break:break-all;margin-top:6px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0\\">버튼이 열리지 않으면 아래 링크를 브라우저에 붙여 넣어 주세요: <a href=\\"https://sampleco.test/api/marketing/keep?t=test-keep-token\\" style=\\"color:#555555;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline\\" target=\\"_blank\\">https://sampleco.test/api/marketing/keep?t=test-keep-token</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\\"center\\" width=\\"100%\\" border=\\"0\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"margin:0 0 12px\\"><tbody><tr><td><a href=\\"https://sampleco.test/api/marketing/unsubscribe?t=test-unsubscribe-token\\" style=\\"line-height:100%;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:6px;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;padding:11px 19px;padding-top:11px;padding-right:19px;padding-bottom:11px;padding-left:19px\\" target=\\"_blank\\"><span><!--[if mso]><i style=\\"mso-font-width:475%;mso-text-raise:16.5px\\" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style=\\"max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:8.25px\\">수신거부</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style=\\"mso-font-width:475%\\" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a><p data-skip-in-text=\\"true\\" data-lf-fallback-link=\\"true\\" style=\\"font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#777777;margin:6px 0 0;word-break:break-all;margin-top:6px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0\\">버튼이 열리지 않으면 아래 링크를 브라우저에 붙여 넣어 주세요: <a href=\\"https://sampleco.test/api/marketing/unsubscribe?t=test-unsubscribe-token\\" style=\\"color:#555555;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline\\" target=\\"_blank\\">https://sampleco.test/api/marketing/unsubscribe?t=test-unsubscribe-token</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">이 링크는 60일 동안만 쓸 수 있어요.</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">두 번째 버튼으로 언제든 수신거부할 수 있어요. 로그인하지 않아도 돼요.</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">아무것도 하지 않으면 그대로 계속 받게 돼요. 수신거부하기 전까지 메일이 가요.</p><hr style=\\"width:100%;border:none;border-color:#e5e5e5;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;margin:24px 0 16px\\"/><p style=\\"font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#777777;margin:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0\\">SampleCo 계정이 있어서 보내 드리는 메일이에요.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>",
  "text": "광고성 메일을 계속 받을까요?\\n\\n지민님, 안녕하세요.\\n\\n전송자: SampleCo Inc. — 2024년 9월 30일에 광고성 메일 수신에 동의하셨어요.\\n\\n법에 따라 2년마다 계속 받고 싶은지 확인해요.\\n\\n계속 받기 https://sampleco.test/api/marketing/keep?t=test-keep-token\\n\\n수신거부 https://sampleco.test/api/marketing/unsubscribe?t=test-unsubscribe-token\\n\\n이 링크는 60일 동안만 쓸 수 있어요.\\n\\n두 번째 버튼으로 언제든 수신거부할 수 있어요. 로그인하지 않아도 돼요.\\n\\n아무것도 하지 않으면 그대로 계속 받게 돼요. 수신거부하기 전까지 메일이 가요.\\n\\n----------------------------------------\\n\\nSampleCo 계정이 있어서 보내 드리는 메일이에요."
}
`;

exports[`스냅숏: newDeviceSignIn (en) 1`] = `
{
  "subject": "New sign-in to your SampleCo account",
