  "subject": "Your SampleCo order is confirmed: Pro",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \\"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\\" \\"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\\"><html dir=\\"ltr\\" lang=\\"en\\"><head><meta content=\\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\\" http-equiv=\\"Content-Type\\"/><meta name=\\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\\"/><title>Thanks for your order. Here are the details.</title></head><body dir=\\"ltr\\" lang=\\"en\\" style=\\"background-color:#f6f6f4;margin:0;padding:0\\"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><div style=\\"display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0\\" data-skip-in-text=\\"true\\">Thanks for your order. Here are the details.<div> ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿</div></div><!--body--><table border=\\"0\\" width=\\"100%\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" align=\\"center\\"><tbody><tr><td dir=\\"ltr\\" lang=\\"en\\" style=\\"background-color:#f6f6f4;font-family:-apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, &#x27;Apple SD Gothic Neo&#x27;, &#x27;Malgun Gothic&#x27;, sans-serif;margin:0;padding:24px 0\\"><table align=\\"center\\" width=\\"100%\\" border=\\"0\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"max-width:560px;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;margin:0 auto\\"><tbody><tr style=\\"width:100%\\"><td style=\\"padding:32px\\"><h1 style=\\"color:#1a1a1a;font-size:22px;line-height:30px;margin:0 0 16px\\">Your order is confirmed</h1><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">Hi Jamie,</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">Thanks for your order. Here are the details.</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 4px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0\\">Order number: ord_01JH2X</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 4px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0\\">Plan: Pro</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 4px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0\\">Amount: $9.00 (plus applicable tax)</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 4px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0\\">Order date: September 30, 2026</p><p style=\\"font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#333333;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0\\">Your receipt comes in a separate email from Paddle, our payment provider and reseller.</p><table align=\\"center\\" width=\\"100%\\" border=\\"0\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"margin:20px 0 8px\\"><tbody><tr><td><table align=\\"center\\" width=\\"100%\\" border=\\"0\\" cellPadding=\\"0\\" cellSpacing=\\"0\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"margin:0 0 12px\\"><tbody><tr><td><a href=\\"https://sampleco.test/billing\\" style=\\"line-height:100%;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;background-color:#1a1a1a;border-radius:6px;color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;padding:12px 20px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:20px\\" target=\\"_blank\\"><span><!--[if mso]><i style=\\"mso-font-width:500%;mso-text-raise:18px\\" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style=\\"max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px\\">Manage your subscription</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style=\\"mso-font-width:500%\\" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a><p data-skip-in-text=\\"true\\" data-lf-fallback-link=\\"true\\" style=\\"font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#777777;margin:6px 0 0;word-break:break-all;margin-top:6px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0\\">If the button doesn&#x27;t work, copy this link into your browser: <a href=\\"https://sampleco.test/billing\\" style=\\"color:#555555;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline\\" target=\\"_blank\\">https://sampleco.test/billing</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><hr style=\\"width:100%;border:none;border-color:#e5e5e5;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;margin:24px 0 16px\\"/><p style=\\"font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#777777;margin:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0\\">You are receiving this email because you have an account with SampleCo.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>",
  "text": "YOUR ORDER IS CONFIRMED\\n\\nHi Jamie,\\n\\nThanks for your order. Here are the details.\\n\\nOrder number: ord_01JH2X\\n\\nPlan: Pro\\n\\nAmount: $9.00 (plus applicable tax)\\n\\nOrder date: September 30, 2026\\n\\nYour receipt comes in a separate email from Paddle, our payment provider and reseller.\\n\\nManage your subscription https://sampleco.test/billing\\n\\n----------------------------------------\\n\\nYou are receiving this email because you have an account with SampleCo."
}
`;

